      "id": "claim_df9942fa48c84ed7bde62e541f47e8d3",
      "statement": "The home page (frontend/src/routes/(main)/+page.svelte) is a scroll-driven narrative whose sections — hero with SmartSearch, animated stats counters, CoffeeJourney, 'explore every dimension' feature cards, call-to-action, FAQ accordion, and attributions — are revealed by an IntersectionObserver that toggles per-section visibility flags; smooth scrolling is provided by a Lenis instance initialised in onMount and passed down to CoffeeJourney.",
