      "id": "claim_f9a131eb9d13488986cfa22e612376ea",
      "statement": "The SmartSearch text flow is: SmartSearch.handleSearch calls the home page's onSearch → searchStore.performSmartSearch → api.smartSearchParameters (POST /api/v1/ai/search with body {query}) → backend returns SmartSearchResponse.data.search_params (SmartSearchParameters) → api maps SmartSearchParameters to flat SearchParams (e.g. search_text→query, tasting_notes_search→tasting_notes_query) → searchStore applies the mapped fields to its filter state and calls performNewSearch → api.search (GET /api/v1/search) → results stored in allResults and URL updated.",
