    {
      "id": "claim_cce8086586764a39a6a86cfef6240a95",
      "statement": "The two discovery paths (AI natural-language/image search via SmartSearch, and visual browse entry points via flavours/processes/varietals routes) both converge on the same GET /api/v1/search endpoint and the same searchStore state, so the faceted filtering UI on /search can refine any result set regardless of whether it originated from a natural-language query, a flavour-wheel click, or a direct URL — this convergence is the core design rationale for addressing users who lack coffee terminology.",
